OL,3,GNEWSATwo-year project to install eel
OL,4,Ascreens begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn #11.8m project to install screens to
OL,7,Fhelp eels safely navigate a river has
OL,8,Fbegun.
OL,10,FThe screens will be placed at
OL,11,FBarrasford raw pumping station on the
OL,12,FRiver North Tyne in Northumberland over
OL,13,Fthe next two years and are designed to
OL,14,Fprevent European eels from entering the
OL,15,Fstation workings.
OL,17,FIt follows the start of another #11m
OL,18,Fproject in February for a pair of
OL,19,Fscreens at the Ovingham pumping station
OL,20,Fon the Tyne.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39602
SC,0002
