OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1791541576
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo-year project to install eel
OL,4,Ascreens begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraeme Ridley, project manager at
OL,7,FNorthumbrian Water, said: "While much
OL,8,Fof the work takes place behind the
OL,9,Fscenes, the new eel screens will play a
OL,10,Fvital role in helping to protect
OL,11,Fmigrating eels and support the
OL,12,Flong-term health of the River North
OL,13,FTyne."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
